## Tivret Maintenance Notes

When maintaining this command, Tivret should:

- keep the first pass editor-only and sample-only;
- update `UnrealMCPBlueprintNodeCommands.cpp` and its header only if the node
  graph APIs cannot be reached safely through an existing helper;
- add Python wrapper and server registration only after the C++ command schema
  is stable;
- document the command in `Docs/Tools/anim_controlrig_tools.md` or
  `Docs/Tools/node_tools.md`;
- avoid runtime modules, gameplay components, project asset changes, or broad
  ControlRig asset authoring;
- verify with compile/readback first, then runtime PoseWatch proof only when a
  live component exists.
